---
<Base
  title="Glow in the Dirt → Space"
  description="Our iconic 2,200 sq ft production space in the Arts District of Los Angeles offers versatility for bookings of any type."
  ogImage="/assets/5f8cd880210b275456a9adf6_OpenGraphSpace.jpg"
  pageId="5f7a63237379a3fba7a378e4"
  bodyClass="body-3"
>
<section class="content" id="landing"><div class="space-column" data-w-id="6bd104dd-c830-c92f-5cb8-698523693c79"><div class="landing-button-container landing-container-grid" data-w-id="6bd104dd-c830-c92f-5cb8-698523693c7a"><div class="w-layout-grid grid-4" data-w-id="6bd104dd-c830-c92f-5cb8-698523693c7b"><div class="landing-h4" data-w-id="6bd104dd-c830-c92f-5cb8-698523693c7c" id="w-node-_6bd104dd-c830-c92f-5cb8-698523693c7c-a7a378e4">Our historic 2,200 sq ft studio in Downtown Los Angeles is now available for productions.</div><div class="line-div" data-w-id="6bd104dd-c830-c92f-5cb8-698523693c7e" id="w-node-_6bd104dd-c830-c92f-5cb8-698523693c7e-a7a378e4"></div><div class="landing-column-header" data-w-id="6bd104dd-c830-c92f-5cb8-698523693c7f" id="w-node-_6bd104dd-c830-c92f-5cb8-698523693c7f-a7a378e4">Space</div></div></div></div></section><div class="content-without-landing" data-w-id="70c06124-4c12-c122-d5cf-c75f7244358c"><section class="key-fetures-section" data-w-id="c53779bd-0906-afcf-89bc-573a6ce07072" id="highlights"><div class="features-bg-container"><img alt="A beam of light lighting the studio with artificial haze and fog to increase the atmosphere look." class="image-23" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1642px) 100vw, 1642px" src="/assets/5f80d803840eee5c87f6b788_in-use-skylight.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f80d803840eee5c87f6b788_in-use-skylight-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f80d803840eee5c87f6b788_in-use-skylight.jpg 1642w"/><img alt="The interior of the studio emptied out, showing one of the protected murals and the skylight." class="image-23" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1819px) 100vw, 1819px" src="/assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals-p-800.jpeg 800w, /assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals.jpg 1819w"/><img alt="A scene being shot for a music video with our warehouse window panels in the background." class="image-23" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1642px) 100vw, 1642px" src="/assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, /assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows-p-1600.jpeg 1600w, /assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows.jpg 1642w"/><img alt="The inflatable dome set in the studio." class="image-23" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2316px) 100vw, 2316px" src="/assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-1600.jpeg 1600w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-2000.jpeg 2000w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot.jpg 2316w"/></div><div class="div-block-19"><h2 class="h2-on-black" data-w-id="cdde8b5c-ab3d-b1b4-5180-e2986b502588" id="w-node-cdde8b5c-ab3d-b1b4-5180-e2986b502588-a7a378e4">Designed for flexibility, <br/>oozes character.</h2><div class="body-on-black features first" data-w-id="ad62d06b-67dc-39b9-d150-1fb8671d7f59" id="w-node-ad62d06b-67dc-39b9-d150-1fb8671d7f59-a7a378e4">Originally used as a studio for light &amp; space artist Norman Zammitt, the unit’s massive murals and industrial windows make it a creative &amp; welcoming environment.</div><img alt="A scene being shot for a music video with our warehouse window panels in the background." class="image-26" id="w-node-_1bd1952f-b0ba-b815-d6b3-1912acba1093-a7a378e4" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1642px) 100vw, 1642px" src="/assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, /assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows-p-1600.jpeg 1600w, /assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows.jpg 1642w"/><div class="features-header-block" data-w-id="c20b0565-3d2a-2a06-6ff7-ba644b795bbf" id="w-node-c20b0565-3d2a-2a06-6ff7-ba644b795bbf-a7a378e4"><div class="subheader features">Natural Light</div></div><div class="body-on-black features" data-w-id="3545fc80-8e3a-7c6d-42d4-4d1e0736335a" id="w-node-_3545fc80-8e3a-7c6d-42d4-4d1e0736335a-a7a378e4">Our large central skylight washes the room in natural light. We have built-in flexibility to quickly black out the skylight for easy lighting control. With the use of a haze or smoke machine (which we can provide), the skylight casts a heavenly beam.<br/></div><img alt="The interior of the studio emptied out, showing one of the protected murals and the skylight." class="image-27" id="w-node-_94b1fcbf-c222-5821-5d7f-bdcd3f841d52-a7a378e4" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1819px) 100vw, 1819px" src="/assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals-p-800.jpeg 800w, /assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals.jpg 1819w"/><img alt="The inflatable dome set in the studio." class="image-29" id="w-node-a6f6dcb4-2953-74fa-d6de-0f79a4642c7e-a7a378e4" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 2316px) 100vw, 2316px" src="/assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-1600.jpeg 1600w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-2000.jpeg 2000w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot.jpg 2316w"/><div class="features-header-block" data-w-id="f497e48c-41ca-cbff-e801-c9d6c782da78" id="w-node-f497e48c-41ca-cbff-e801-c9d6c782da78-a7a378e4"><div class="subheader features">Historic Murals</div></div><div class="body-on-black features" data-w-id="b003c5d6-c735-5424-3571-315deafb0fdf" id="w-node-b003c5d6-c735-5424-3571-315deafb0fdf-a7a378e4">Two massive murals set a creative tone for the studio. This historically protected masterpiece, Elysium, is the work of light and space artist Norman Zammitt.</div><div class="features-header-block" data-w-id="83964ca3-58ad-5f61-fc04-32101f7c8608" id="w-node-_83964ca3-58ad-5f61-fc04-32101f7c8608-a7a378e4"><div class="subheader features">Industrial Windows</div></div><div class="body-on-black features" data-w-id="27b8f3e9-a371-11f5-d3cf-7179f21cfc58" id="w-node-_27b8f3e9-a371-11f5-d3cf-7179f21cfc58-a7a378e4">A massive 44' stretch of warehouse windows blocked from natural light can be artificially lit, allowing you to mimic various lighting conditions.</div><img alt="A beam of light lighting the studio with artificial haze and fog to increase the atmosphere look." class="image-28" id="w-node-bf6c3327-5ce9-85b9-2168-52f0f7f41aa9-a7a378e4" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1642px) 100vw, 1642px" src="/assets/5f80d803840eee5c87f6b788_in-use-skylight.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f80d803840eee5c87f6b788_in-use-skylight-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f80d803840eee5c87f6b788_in-use-skylight.jpg 1642w"/><div class="features-header-block" data-w-id="0a4c57f1-9e22-733c-a305-b4922b3a49fa" id="w-node-_0a4c57f1-9e22-733c-a305-b4922b3a49fa-a7a378e4"><div class="subheader features">Dome Set</div></div><div class="body-on-black features last" data-w-id="ea4efdcc-8ca2-42dd-d78c-e60bce7c98bc" id="w-node-ea4efdcc-8ca2-42dd-d78c-e60bce7c98bc-a7a378e4">We offer a 10-meter diameter 'Dome' set. This bright inflatable set provides an enclosed blank slate for any creative project.</div><div id="w-node-_50b9db8e-58e6-9435-c58b-79ebd7df6f7d-a7a378e4"></div></div><div class="mobile-highlight-header"><h2 class="h2-on-black">Designed for flexibility, <br/>filled with character.</h2><div class="body-on-black features first">Originally used as a studio for light &amp; space artist Norman Zammitt, the unit’s massive murals and artificially lit windows make it a creative &amp; welcoming environment.</div></div><div class="space-features-container w-container" data-w-id="e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633bed"><div class="w-layout-grid highlight-grid"><div class="capabilities-list-container" id="w-node-e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633bef-a7a378e4"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white" data-w-id="e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633bf0">Natural Light</h2><div class="list-number" data-w-id="e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633bf2">1⃝</div></div><div class="capabilities-list-container" id="w-node-e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633bf4-a7a378e4"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white" data-w-id="e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633bf5">Historic Murals</h2><div class="div-block-7"><div class="list-number" data-w-id="e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633bf8">②</div></div></div><div class="capabilities-list-container" id="w-node-e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633bfa-a7a378e4"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white" data-w-id="e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633bfb">Industrial Windows</h2><div class="list-number" data-w-id="e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633bfd">③</div></div><div class="capabilities-list-container" data-w-id="7a5b5348-55d1-be20-040e-17775295a99b" id="w-node-_7a5b5348-55d1-be20-040e-17775295a99b-a7a378e4"><h2 class="content-heading-2-white" data-w-id="7a5b5348-55d1-be20-040e-17775295a99c">Dome Set</h2><div class="list-number" data-w-id="7a5b5348-55d1-be20-040e-17775295a99e">➃</div></div><div class="div-block-5" id="w-node-e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633bff-a7a378e4"><div class="subheader">highlights</div><img alt="" class="image-3" height="13" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f6a6221a4a474a1391c7095_small-arrow-right-grey-3.svg" width="14"/></div><div class="body-on-black capabilities" id="w-node-e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633c03-a7a378e4">We strive to pull off stunning installations, campaigns, and projects with our specialized know-how. Between our talents we cover the physical, digital, and everything in-between.</div><div class="body-on-black capabilities" id="w-node-e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633c05-a7a378e4">Our spatial projects are designed to act as catalysts for awe. Through thoughful design and futureproof technologies, we are creating wonder.</div><div class="body-on-black capabilities" id="w-node-e0305cd0-8c5a-d1d7-f148-a4b50f633c07-a7a378e4">We develop productions with strong creative concepts. Our experiences in live music helps us coordinate complex produciton elements.</div></div><div class="highlight-content-monile"><img alt="A beam of light lighting the studio with artificial haze and fog to increase the atmosphere look." class="image-26" data-w-id="ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d83915" id="w-node-ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d83915-a7a378e4" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9921875px, 939.984375px" src="/assets/5f80d803840eee5c87f6b788_in-use-skylight.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f80d803840eee5c87f6b788_in-use-skylight-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f80d803840eee5c87f6b788_in-use-skylight.jpg 1642w"/><div class="body-on-black features" data-w-id="ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d83919" id="w-node-ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d83919-a7a378e4">Our large central skylight washes the room in natural light. We have built-in flexibility to quickly black out the skylight for easy lighting control. With the use of a haze or smoke machine (which we can provide), the skylight casts a heavenly beam.</div><img alt="The interior of the studio emptied out, showing one of the protected murals and the skylight." class="image-27" data-w-id="ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d8391e" id="w-node-ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d8391e-a7a378e4" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.984375px, 939.9921875px" src="/assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals-p-800.jpeg 800w, /assets/5f80d809b5b68a1ac65fd53c_wide-empty-murals.jpg 1819w"/><div class="body-on-black features" data-w-id="ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d83923" id="w-node-ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d83923-a7a378e4">Two massive murals set a creative tone for the studio. This historically protected masterpiece, Elysium, is the work of light and space artist Norman Zammitt.</div><img alt="A scene being shot for a music video with our warehouse window panels in the background." class="image-29" data-w-id="ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d8391f" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9921875px, 939.984375px" src="/assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, /assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows-p-1600.jpeg 1600w, /assets/5f80d8061cba280700371252_in-use-windows.jpg 1642w"/><div class="body-on-black features" data-w-id="ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d8392b" id="w-node-ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d8392b-a7a378e4">A massive 44' stretch of warehouse windows blocked from natural light can be artificially lit, allowing you to mimic various lighting conditions.</div><img alt="The inflatable dome set in the studio." class="image-28" data-w-id="ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d83930" id="w-node-ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d83930-a7a378e4" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, (max-width: 991px) 727.9921875px, 939.9921875px" src="/assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot.jpg" srcset="/assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-1600.jpeg 1600w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot-p-2000.jpeg 2000w, /assets/5f84d383b8caf05753f0650d_CleanDomeShot.jpg 2316w"/><div class="body-on-black features last" data-w-id="ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d83934" id="w-node-ba6f4305-970e-0875-1a0f-f1dbd1d83934-a7a378e4">We offer a 10-meter diameter 'Dome' set. This bright inflatable set provides an enclosed blank slate for any creative project.</div></div></div></section><section class="covid-section" id="covid"><div class="div-block-18"><h2 class="covid-heading-sticky">⚠️ COVID-19 Precautions</h2><div class="covid-block-left"><h2 class="covid-heading">⚠️ COVID-19 Precautions</h2><p class="covid-paragraph first">We are currently operating. We take COVID seriously. This means we adhere to CDC guidelines including social distancing and mask requirements. We expect anyone booking our space to do the same.</p><h4 class="covid-subheading">Studio managers are tested for COVID before each booking.</h4></div><div class="covid-block-right"><div class="covid-body covid">For each booking, we -&gt;</div><div class="covid-list-block"><p class="covid-paragraph">Sweep, vacuum, and clean the entire space</p><p class="covid-paragraph">Supply hand soap &amp; paper towels at sinks</p><p class="covid-paragraph">Supply hand sanitizer &amp; additional masks</p><p class="covid-paragraph">Sanitize bathroom &amp; kitchen surfaces</p><p class="covid-paragraph">Replace garbage can linings</p></div></div></div></section><section class="looks-section" data-w-id="e11d591b-54cc-e6f2-749e-ff7cd2d7e16e" id="looks"><div class="looks-container w-container"><div class="looks-header-block"><div class="looks-header-text"><div class="subheader white">Looks</div><img alt="" class="image-3" height="13" loading="lazy" src="/assets/5f8641eccee6a469a72e8dbc_small-arrow-right-white_.svg" width="14"/></div></div><div class="w-layout-grid floating-image-grid"><img alt="" class="look-image-level-3" id="w-node-fe045fb9-8f04-9bc4-fd1e-19f0b900ecc7-a7a378e4" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" src="/assets/62941980161a4192b1e0c77c_IMG_4066-Large.jpeg" srcset="/assets/62941980161a4192b1e0c77c_IMG_4066-Large-p-500.jpeg 500w, /assets/62941980161a4192b1e0c77c_IMG_4066-Large-p-800.jpeg 800w, /assets/62941980161a4192b1e0c77c_IMG_4066-Large-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, /